# Aminatou: "Its miracle cost is equal to its mana cost reduced by {4}." The Meathook Massacre's mana cost is {X}{B}{B}:
# the miracle cost is that cost reduced by {4} as the total cost is determined, once X is announced (CR 107.3a, 601.2f),
